{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3106","id":3323526933,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887GGP8V","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3106","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3106.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3106.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3106","number":3106,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(policy/v2): use TrimPrefix for leading @ in username resolution","user":{"login":"lokkju","id":235371,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTM3MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/235371?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lokkju","html_url":"https://github.com/lokkju","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lokkju/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lokkju/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lokkju/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lokkju/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lokkju/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lokkju/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lokkju/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lokkju/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lokkju/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Fix `Username.resolveUser` to strip the **leading** `@` from usernames using `TrimPrefix` instead of `TrimSuffix`\n- The ACL policy format uses `@username` (leading `@`), but `TrimSuffix` only strips a trailing `@`, so no group member usernames ever matched, causing all group-based ACL rules to silently compile to empty filter sets\n\n## Root Cause\n\n```go\n// Before (bug): trailing @ stripped, but policy uses leading @\nuTrimmed := strings.TrimSuffix(u.String(), \"@\")\n// \"@laronica.lawson\" → \"@laronica.lawson\" (unchanged, never matches)\n\n// After (fix): strip both leading and trailing @\nuTrimmed := strings.TrimPrefix(strings.TrimSuffix(u.String(), \"@\"), \"@\")\n// \"@laronica.lawson\" → \"laronica.lawson\" (matches user.Name)\n```\n\n## Impact\n\nThis bug caused:\n- All group-based ACL source rules to produce empty IP sets (silently skipped)\n- `/debug/filter` returning `null` when only group-based rules exist\n- `ReduceRoutes` and `BuildPeerMap` seeing no matchers, so subnet routes were never distributed to group members\n- The `src: *` workaround bypassed the bug because wildcard sources don't go through `resolveUser`\n\n## Verification\n\nTested on a live headscale v0.27.1 deployment with:\n- A subnet router advertising `10.0.0.0/8` and a 4via6 prefix\n- Group-based ACLs (`group:n8n → n8n-svc:5678`)\n- Before fix: `/debug/filter` = `null`, router not visible in peer netmap\n- After fix: filter rules correctly compiled, router visible with scoped routes, end-to-end connectivity confirmed\n\nAll existing policy tests pass.\n\nFixes #3104","created_at":"2026-02-25T02:59:57Z","updated_at":"2026-02-25T19:07:19Z","closed_at":"2026-02-25T18:14:27Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"8e1a6a4f4a25d062dee5e066574a3ef230e6d182","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.co